</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Lord, now indeed I find</l><l>Thy pow’r, and Thine alone,</l><l>Can change the leper’s spots,</l><l>And melt the heart of stone.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>For nothing good have I</l><l>Whereby Thy grace to claim—</l><l>I’ll wash my garments white</l><l>In the blood of Calv’ry’s Lamb.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>And when, before the throne,</l><l>I stand in Him complete,</l><l>“Jesus died my soul to save,</l><l>My lips shall still repeat.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
